# Vercel serves only static/ (vercel.json outputDirectory). Exclude the Python
# pipeline, the SQLite DB, caches, and the venv from the upload. Paths are
# root-anchored (leading slash) so static/data/ is NOT matched by /data/.
/venv/
/data/
/scripts/
/sources/
/migrations/
/tests/
/config/
/docs/
/.pytest_cache/
/sy
/requirements.txt
/AGENTS.md
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.db
.DS_Store
